      "The most quoted number in enterprise AI this year is that roughly 88% of agent pilots never reach production. It originated in Anaconda and Forrester research, has been replicated in independent surveys by a16z and the MIT Sloan CIO panel, and Gartner's version of the figure lands at 89%. When four sources with different methods converge, the number is usually describing something real.",
