      "Building an evaluation set that keeps pace produces a regression suite grounded in real cases plus a cadence for refreshing it. This is the one clients understand least and need most, because drift is invisible until it is expensive.",
      "## Who is positioned to sell this",
      "Not the model vendors, whose incentive is to demonstrate capability rather than to constrain it. Not the large integrators in most cases, whose economics favour longer programmes than these.",
