      "What happened instead is that a large volume of queries now resolve without a click at all. The user reads the answer and leaves. That traffic did not go somewhere else. It stopped existing.",
      "This matters because the two readings produce opposite strategies. If traffic moved, you chase it. If traffic ceased, chasing is wasted effort and the question becomes what replaces the function that traffic served.",
      "## Who absorbs the loss",
